#. y1:english="Hey!{PA:20}||You saw a guy in a yellow suit, didn't you?\nWho are these people...?\nWho the hell are you?\nWe're looking for someone.{PA:20}||I heard he ran in here...\nI guess you didn't see him.\n..Maybe, {PA:10}it's that guy||that just came running in here.\nMotoki or something...\n...{PA:10}Motoki?!{PA:10}||Hey girl, {PA:10}you know something, don't you?\nUm...\nYou better say something||unless you wanna get hurt.\n.........\nHe left.\nWhat?!\nHe was here for a while,{PA:10}||but he's gone now.\n...Was he carrying something...{PA:20}||like a briefcase?\n...I don't know.\nAlright... {PA:20}Sorry to bother you.\nHmm? {PA:10}That briefcase...{PA:10}||Lemme take a look at that.\n...It's Haruka's.{PA:10}||Don't be grabbing it like it's yours now.\nWhat? {PA:10}So you don't want me||to look inside it, huh...?\nYou gotta be hiding something...\nWhat's in there is none of your business.\nYou'll be sorry,||if you don't do what I say...{PA:20}\nHey! {PA:10}Get this motherfucker!\n"
