#. y1:english="So... {PA:10}How'd it go?\nWe won a lot!{PA:20}||Isn't that great!\nWow! {PA:20}Excellent!{PA:20}||I had a feeling you would.\nHey! {PA:20}Who were those guys?\nHuh? {PA:20}What happened?\n...Some scary guys came{PA:10}\nand tried to take this briefcase||away from me.\n(Damn... {PA:20}{PA:20}They already know?)\nYou got some explaining to do.\nWell... {PA:10}Umm... {PA:10}They're...{PA:10}||They're some of my associates, {PA:10}yeah.\nAssociates?\nY... {PA:10}yes. {PA:20}Umm... {PA:10}I'm{PA:20}||in the city council.\nI've been negotiating{PA:10} with the families{PA:10}||to revise some ordinances.\nIf you donate some money to me,{PA:10}\nI'll permit all sorts of adult||entertainment businesses!!\nHahahaha.\n...Really?\nYes!\nAnyway,{PA:20}||can you give me back the chips you won?\nI'm in a hurry.{PA:20}||Hahahaha.\nWait a second.{PA:20}||Haruka and I won this much money.\nIt wouldn't be fair{PA:10}||if you took all the money we won, would it?\nUhh, {PA:10}yeah... {PA:10}that's true.{PA:20}||Then, {PA:10}here you go.\nYou received 10,000 yen.\nHey, what the hell is this?{PA:10}\nWe won all that money,{PA:20}||and you're only giving us 10,000 yen?!\nWell, {PA:10}sorry, {PA:10}but I only have {PA:10}10,000 yen||on me right now...\nWill you please {PA:10}let me||go without a fuss?\nOh, {PA:10}and gimme {PA:10}those chips,{PA:20}||please?\nI'm gonna be in deep shit any minute now.{PA:20}||Hahahaha.\nHey, {PA:10}easy there.{PA:20}\nWhy don't you at least buy a round of||drinks or something?\nUhh...{PA:20}||Well... {PA:10}Maybe {PA:10}next time...\nI really{PA:20}||gotta get going.\n...Why are you in such a hurry?{PA:20}||Those guys are your associates, {PA:10}right?\nI think you're hiding something, {PA:10}mister.\nNo no no...{PA:20}||Well, {PA:10}to tell you {PA:10}the truth...\n...Okay.{PA:20}||Take it.\nTh... {PA:10}thank you very much!!\nYou gave all the chips.\n\nWell,{PA:10}||I'm gonna get going.\nI'll improve this town yet! {PA:20}Hahahaha.\n"
