#. y1:english="Oh, Kazuma-san?!||So you knew about this casino after all.\nWell, yeah. How did you know about it, Yuzu?\nA girl at our bar told me about it.\nAnd I've played here alone before... But||I've been losing... I feel like crying...\nHow much did you lose?\nUm... About 200,000 yen...\nI see.\nKazuma-san, I'm so frustrated!||I don't wanna go home until I break even!\nOh, I see.\nGive her 200,000 yen?\n\nWhat...? Are you sure?!\nI can't accept...\nDon't worry about it.||You should try again with that money.\nThere is only one method||to winning in a casino.\nMethod?\nThat is to not give up until you win.\nTeehee...||That doesn't work, does it?\nStill, thanks anyway.\nOh, please take this...\nYou received the \"Engraved Sword Tesshusai\"!\n\nWhat's this?\nA strange old man gave it to me||during my losing streak.\nHe said it's a very expensive sword,||but I don't know what makes it so special...\nPlease use it,||if it's of some help to you...\nI see. Thank you very much.\nYou're welcome.❤\nKazuma-san, I'm so frustrated!||I don't wanna go home until I break even!"
