#. y1:english="Huh?{PA:10} Who the hell are you?\nGive him the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Tab{CR:00}\"?\nYou...{PA:10} Oh...{PA:20}\nThe bartender must've sent you to collect||the tab, huh.\n||{MS:1}{MS:0}Lucky guess.\nYou know.||I'm not intending to flake on my tab.\nI'll pay back all of it,||once I win at this casino.\nYou mean I have to wait until you win?\nWell, {PA:10}there is an item called \"{CC:ffc8c8}Lucky Beads{CR:00}\".\nI had one before||and I won game after game.\nBut I lost it when I was drunk.\nIf only I had some \"{CC:ffc8c8}Lucky Beads{CR:00}\",||I'd win for sure.{PA:20}\nThen, I'd pay back all of my tab||in a lump sum.\n\nGive him the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Lucky Beads{CR:00}\"?\nDon't talk to me if you don't have||anything to say,{PA:10} idiot.\nWow!{PA:10} Are you sure you're giving||these to me?{PA:10} Good,{PA:10} good, good!\nNow I can pay my tab.\nI promise to pay you.{PA:20}||Thanks a lot.{PA:10} I mean it.\n(I don't think I have such an item...)\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0086.BIN:45_0_1
